        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>FORM 990, PAGE 6, PART VI, LINE 11B</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>DURING THE WEEK PRIOR TO FILING, THE COMPLETED FORM 990 IS SENT TO ALL DIRECTORS AND OFFICERS FOR THEIR REVIEW. THE EXECUTIVE DIRECTOR (NOT A BOARD MEMBER) THEN DOUBLE CHECKS/APPROVES WITH KSO TAX CPA, WHO FILES THE 990.</ExplanationTxt>
      </SupplementalInformationDetail>
      <SupplementalInformationDetail>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>FORM 990, PAGE 6, PART VI, LINE 12C</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>DIRECTORS AND OFFICERS MANAGE THIS BEFORE AND DURING EACH ANNUAL BOARD OF DIRECTORS MEETING, CONFIRMING LACK OF CONFLICT AND SIGNING UNDERSTANDING/AGREEMENT.</ExplanationTxt>
